  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nUplevel your office with new decor\n\nUplevel your office with new decor\nOrganizers\nProductivity\nChargers\nDecor\nTotal items in cart: 0\nCraighill Venn Puzzle\n$98.00\nAdd to cart\nSkip to product information\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nOpen image in full screen\nCraighill Venn Puzzle\n$98.00\nDecrease quantity\nIncrease quantity\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Ugmonk.\n\nA beautiful mechanical puzzle comprised of three identical pieces, die-cast in stainless steel and weighing almost 2 pounds.\n\nThe Venn Puzzle is a surprisingly difficult dexterity challenge and intriguing addition to your desk, shelf, or coffee table. The assembled puzzle creates a perfect sphere — so each piece makes up one-third of the sphere by volume. These pieces are cast from molten stainless steel in a ‘die’ or mold at temperatures over 2500°F.\n\nCraighill is a design studio in Brooklyn, NY focused on creating products to be as functional and timeless as they are beautiful and intriguing\n\nWidth\n\n4.5\"\n\nHeight\n\n2.5\"\n\nLength\n\n4.5\"\n\nMade in\n\nUSA\n\nFeatures\nDetails\nShipping & Returns\n\nShop The Full Collection\n\nGather MagSafe Phone Stand\nAdd\nGather MagSafe Phone Stand\n$89.00\nGather Note Tray\nAdd\nGather Note Tray\n$39.00\nGather Small Tray\nAdd\nGather Small Tray\n$49.00\nGather Note Tray\nAdd\nGather Note Tray\n$39.00\n\nJoin our Newsletter — Get Updates, Offers and Invites.\n\nEmail\nShop\nSearch\nBestsellers\nOrganizers\nDecor\nHelp\nFAQ\nPolicies\nContact us\nAbout\nJournal\nOur story\n\nStay Connected\n\n© 2026 Tinker, Powered by Shopify"
